      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out with some research? im looking at how different economic policies affect small business growth in the tech sector. specifically, i want to see a comparison of how strict government oversight vs a more deregulated approach impacts innovation. can u give me a breakdown of the main arguments for both sides?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
